Subject: [PATCH 1/2] refactor(daemon-hosts): R8a step 5 website and desktop
 pass the executor its runtime ports and host env; the bridge probe takes
 spawn and hostEnv

Pairs with Jini R8a step 5 (re-applied on refactor/terra; the Node bindings live in @jini-ai/node-adapters). agent-daemon-scope.ts and desktop-agent.ts state the Node bindings once (node-adapters'), pass { lifecycle, runtime, hostEnv } and call probeMcpBridge with the spawn port; the desktop factory cast is gone.
The eval harness and the run-finalizer integration test are executor callers too (not in the sheet's table): updated here.
typed-tools.integration's scope gets the executorDefinitionPolicies stub C6 broke (13 failures on the base, 0 now).

